{"id":"8cd0bb12bb71a086","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cook-reduction-notation.md","title":"73-df-cook-reduction-notation — cook reduction notation","display":"73-df-cook-reduction-notation — cook reduction notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cook-reduction-notation","display":"73-df-cook-reduction-notation — cook reduction notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime]]","[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","[[73-df-oracle-machine-notation]]"],"aliases":["73-df-cook-reduction-notation","73-definition-10.10"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cook-reduction-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-cook-reduction-notation — cook reduction notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1b6653dcbc23ade\" href=\"?note=e1b6653dcbc23ade\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime\">73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2a55bf7c4b509350\" href=\"?note=2a55bf7c4b509350\" title=\"73-df-oracle-machine-notation\">73-df-oracle-machine-notation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cook-reduction-notation</span><span>73-definition-10.10</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；神谕程序及语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e1b6653dcbc23ade\" href=\"?note=e1b6653dcbc23ade\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime\">73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyTM}^B\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyTM}^B\\)</span> 是带固定神谕的对象集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}^B\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}^B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M^B)\">\\(L(M^B)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2a55bf7c4b509350\" href=\"?note=2a55bf7c4b509350\" title=\"73-df-oracle-machine-notation\">73-df-oracle-machine-notation</a> 的词载体实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.10}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolyTM}^B\\coloneqq\\{(O,B):O\\in\\{P:\\operatorname{OTM}_B(P)\\}\\land\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\},\\qquad\nA\\leq_T^pB\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{PolyTM}^B\\;A=L(M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.10}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PolyTM}^B\\coloneqq\\{(O,B):O\\in\\{P:\\operatorname{OTM}_B(P)\\}\\land\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\},\\qquad\nA\\leq_T^pB\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{PolyTM}^B\\;A=L(M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"e1b6653dcbc23ade","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen